@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Criterion-linked Testing and Closure
start
:Select exact applicable criteria and actual candidate;
:Choose unit, real integration, protocol, journey or recovery level;
:Prepare synthetic actors, grants, data and isolated environment;
:Define expected observable result before execution;
:Execute normal and relevant denied / stale / failure checks;
if (Executed result meets criterion?) then (yes)
 :Record bounded passed result and evidence;
else (no / blocked)
 :Record failure, blocker or unexecuted scope accurately;
 :Link corrective work and affected retest;
endif
:Update RTM and iteration review with limitations;
:Assess release gates separately from slice completion;
stop
@enduml
